m the U.S. Chamber of Commerce, police organizations, and former Democratic Congressman Peter Deutsch, signaling a serious challenge. With no reliable general-election polling, the race hinges on turnout, cost-of-living messaging, and attitudes toward the national environment.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.7798, "margin": 4.68}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.7278, "margin": 3.5}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.7527, "margin": 4.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.7814, "margin": 4.5}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.71, "margin": 4.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.7118, "margin": 4.3}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.7713, "margin": 4.5}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.7678, "margin": 4.5}]}